## AmiDefrag.cd - catalog description (single source of truth for all
## translatable strings).  CatComp/FlexCat-compatible.
##
## Generate the C header:   python3 support/gencat.py header AmiDefrag.cd ../src/amidefrag_strings.h
## Make a translation tmpl:  python3 support/gencat.py ct AmiDefrag.cd deutsch.ct deutsch
## Compile a .catalog:        python3 support/gencat.py catalog AmiDefrag.cd deutsch.ct AmiDefrag.catalog
##
## RULES FOR EDITORS:
##   * Append new messages at the END of their section, never insert in the
##     middle - ids are positional and must stay stable for existing catalogs.
##   * Keep printf-style %-placeholders identical in translations (same
##     count and order; %% is a literal percent sign).
##   * Button strings keep their "|" separators.  The five main-window
##     buttons share one row, so keep their labels short.
##   * The CLI confirmation word YES is not translated: the program always
##     checks for the letters Y E S.
##   * The engines' own progress / journal lines and the DEBUG output stay
##     English on purpose, so bug reports read the same everywhere.
##
#language english
#version 1
#name AmiDefrag
;
