;==========================================================================
; Boot volume (appended 2026-11-07, ids stay positional)
;==========================================================================
MSG_GUI_BOOT_SUFFIX
 - BOOT VOLUME: cannot defragment, click Defragment for why
;
MSG_GUI_BOOT_TITLE
AmiDefrag - Boot volume
;
MSG_GUI_BOOT_BODY
%s (%s:) is the volume the system is running from (SYS:).\n\nAmiDefrag has to inhibit a volume for the whole run so that\nnothing else can write to it while files are moved. The OS,\nWorkbench, LIBS: and AmiDefrag itself are loaded from this\nvolume, so it cannot be inhibited while the system runs.\n\nTo defragment it, boot from another partition or a floppy\nand run AmiDefrag from there. Analysis works as usual.
